<span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:1\">what</span></span> <span class=\"w\"><span style=\"--i:2\">matters.</span></span></span></h1>\n      </div>\n      <span class=\"xhero__badge\">Development-stage targets — subject to financing &amp; program launch</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"xhero__under\">\n      <p class=\"lead\">AFSVHCL™ is committed to measurable, transparent community impact — from neurodivergent inclusion to youth athlete development, education and global diaspora empowerment.</p>\n      <div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn--navy\" href=\"{{url:/membership/}}\">Join the community<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-dark\" href=\"{{url:/partners/}}\">Partner with us<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"c541c8d2","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"impact.pillars","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"3399ad2a","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"impact.pillars\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Impact framework</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Six pillars of impact.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"kgrid kgrid--3\" data-stagger>\n    <article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M9.4 4.2a3.4 3.4 0 0 0-3.4 3.2 3.2 3.2 0 0 0-1.6 5.6 3.4 3.4 0 0 0 3 4.8 3 3 0 0 0 4.6 1.6V5.6a2.6 2.6 0 0 0-2.6-1.4z\"/><path d=\"M14.6 4.2A3.4 3.4 0 0 1 18 7.4a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 1.6 5.6 3.4 3.4 0 0 1-3 4.8 3 3 0 0 1-4.6 1.6\"/><path d=\"M9 10.2c1 .2 1.8.9 2.1 1.8M15 10.2c-1 .2-1.8.9-2.1 1.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Neurodivergent Inclusion</h3>\n      <p>Assessments, tutoring, employment readiness, assistive technology, family support and scholarships — funded by every membership.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M7 4h10v4a5 5 0 0 1-10 0z\"/><path d=\"M7 6H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.6 3.2M17 6h2.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.6 3.2\"/><path d=\"M12 13v4M8.5 20.5h7M9.5 17h5v3.5\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Youth Athlete Development</h3>\n      <p>Year-round multi-sport training, sports science and performance development for youth athletes across Canada.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 6.6C9.8 5 6.6 4.6 3.4 5v13.4c3.2-.4 6.4 0 8.6 1.6 2.2-1.6 5.4-2 8.6-1.6V5c-3.2-.4-6.4 0-8.6 1.6z\"/><path d=\"M12 6.6v13.4\"/><path d=\"M15.8 10.4c.6-1 2.4-.8 2.4.6 0 1.2-2.4 2.6-2.4 2.6s-2.4-1.4-2.4-2.6c0-1.4 1.8-1.6 2.4-.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Education &amp; Mentorship</h3>\n      <p>Academic support, mentorship and life skills integrated with athletic training through MLMSR Mentorship LLC.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"8.6\"/><path d=\"M3.4 12h17.2\"/><path d=\"M12 3.4c2.4 2.4 3.6 5.2 3.6 8.6s-1.2 6.2-3.6 8.6c-2.4-2.4-3.6-5.2-3.6-8.6s1.2-6.2 3.6-8.6z\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Global Diaspora Community</h3>\n      <p>Connecting Canada&#39;s multicultural communities worldwide to support youth development and community empowerment.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.6 12.4l3.6-4.2 3.6 1.4 2.4-1.4 3.2.4 3.8 3.6\"/><path d=\"M2.6 12.4l3.4 3.2M21.4 12.2l-3.2 3.4\"/><path d=\"M8.6 14.6l1.6 1.6a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.7 0l.2-.2M11 13.4l2.4 2.4a1.2 1.2 0 0 0 1.7 0l.6-.6-3.6-3.8\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Community Partnerships</h3>\n      <p>Public-private partnerships with municipalities, post-secondary institutions, school boards and corporate sponsors.</p>\n      \n    </article><article class=\"kcard\">\n      <span class=\"kcard__ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.6 20.4h16.8\"/><rect x=\"5.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6.4\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"10.6\" y=\"7.6\" width=\"3\" height=\"10.8\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14.4\" rx=\".6\"/></svg></span>\n      <h3>Transparent Reporting</h3>\n      <p>Annual Impact Reports measuring and publishing real outcomes — not just aspirations.</p>\n      \n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"0311bf23","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"impact.fund","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"7fd5c314","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--navy fund\" data-el=\"impact.fund\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"fund__grid\">\n      <div class=\"reveal\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Neurodivergent Inclusion Fund</p>\n        <h2 class=\"h2 mb-m\">Every membership changes a life.</h2>\n        <p class=\"lead mb-l\">AFSVHCL commits a share of every membership to a dedicated Neurodivergent Inclusion Fund — supporting real families, real youth and real outcomes.</p>\n        <div class=\"coins\">\n          <div class=\"coin\"><b>Every</b><span>individual membership</span><em>gives back</em></div>\n          <div class=\"coin coin--gold\"><b>Every</b><span>business membership</span><em>gives more</em></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"fund__fine\">Proposed commitments — subject to program launch and partner capacity.</p>\n      </div>\n      \n  <div class=\"orbit\" data-stagger>\n    <div class=\"orbit__core\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Neurodivergent</span><b>Inclusion Fund</b><small>Measured &amp; reported annually</small></div>\n    <div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:0\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M9.4 4.2a3.4 3.4 0 0 0-3.4 3.2 3.2 3.2 0 0 0-1.6 5.6 3.4 3.4 0 0 0 3 4.8 3 3 0 0 0 4.6 1.6V5.6a2.6 2.6 0 0 0-2.6-1.4z\"/><path d=\"M14.6 4.2A3.4 3.4 0 0 1 18 7.4a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 1.6 5.6 3.4 3.4 0 0 1-3 4.8 3 3 0 0 1-4.6 1.6\"/><path d=\"M9 10.2c1 .2 1.8.9 2.1 1.8M15 10.2c-1 .2-1.8.9-2.1 1.8\"/></svg></span><b>Assessments</b><small>Diagnostic assessments for neurodivergent youth and families.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:1\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 6.6C9.8 5 6.6 4.6 3.4 5v13.4c3.2-.4 6.4 0 8.6 1.6 2.2-1.6 5.4-2 8.6-1.6V5c-3.2-.4-6.4 0-8.6 1.6z\"/><path d=\"M12 6.6v13.4\"/><path d=\"M15.8 10.4c.6-1 2.4-.8 2.4.6 0 1.2-2.4 2.6-2.4 2.6s-2.4-1.4-2.4-2.6c0-1.4 1.8-1.6 2.4-.6z\"/></svg></span><b>Tutoring &amp; Education</b><small>Specialized tutoring and academic support programs.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:2\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 20.4h16\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"4\" width=\"12\" height=\"16.4\" rx=\".8\"/><path d=\"M9 7.6h2M13 7.6h2M9 11h2M13 11h2M9 14.4h2M13 14.4h2M10.6 20.4v-3h2.8v3\"/></svg></span><b>Employment Readiness</b><small>Job training and employment preparation for neurodivergent individuals.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:3\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"2.8\" width=\"10\" height=\"18.4\" rx=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M10.6 18h2.8\"/></svg></span><b>Assistive Technology</b><small>Technology tools and resources to support learning and development.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:4\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"6.4\" r=\"2.4\"/><circle cx=\"5.4\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18.6\" cy=\"9.4\" r=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7.6 20.4v-2.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 8.8 0v2.6\"/><path d=\"M2.2 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 1 4.8-2.8M21.8 18.4v-1a3.2 3.2 0 0 0-4.8-2.8\"/></svg></span><b>Family Support Services</b><small>Counselling, resources and community support for families.</small></div><div class=\"orbit__tile\" style=\"--n:5\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><rect x=\"3.6\" y=\"4\" width=\"16.8\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M7 8h10M7 11h6\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"2.6\"/><path d=\"M14.6 18.2l-.8 3 2.2-1 2.2 1-.8-3\"/></svg></span><b>Scholarships</b><small>Educational scholarships for neurodivergent students and athletes.</small></div>\n  </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"8661afb8","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"impact.targets","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"a58a29b0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section\" data-el=\"impact.targets\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Five-year targets</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Aspirational, and labelled that way.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"xstats\" data-stagger>\n    <div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"10000\">10,000</span><small>+</small></b>\n      <span>Neurodivergent youth supported</span>\n      <em class=\"pill pill--gold\">5-year target</em>\n    </div><div class=\"xstat\">\n      <b><span data-count=\"25000\">25,000</span><small>+</small></b>\n      <span>Families supported</span>\n      <em class=\"pill pill--gold\">5-year target</em>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"xstats__note\">Targets are aspirational and subject to financing, program launch, partner capacity and feasibility analysis. Actual results may differ materially.</p>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"72bd3705","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"impact.reporting","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"6029eb40","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"impact.reporting\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    \n  <div class=\"section-head reveal \">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow mb-s\">Transparency &amp; accountability</p>\n    <h2 class=\"h2\">Annual impact reporting.</h2>\n    <p class=\"body-lg muted\">AFSVHCL is committed to publishing an Annual Impact Report — measuring and disclosing the real-world outcomes of the Neurodivergent Inclusion Fund, community programs and ecosystem partnerships. Impact is not a marketing claim. It is a commitment.</p>\n  </div>\n    <ol class=\"steps3\" data-stagger>\n      <li><span>01</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M3.6 20.4h16.8\"/><rect x=\"5.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"3\" height=\"6.4\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"10.6\" y=\"7.6\" width=\"3\" height=\"10.8\" rx=\".6\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"4\" width=\"3\" height=\"14.4\" rx=\".6\"/></svg><h3>Measured outcomes</h3><p>Quantified results across inclusion, education and community programs.</p></li>\n      <li><span>02</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6.4 2.8h7.8l4.4 4.4v14H6.4z\"/><path d=\"M14.2 2.8v4.4h4.4M9.4 12h6M9.4 15.2h6M9.4 18.4h3.6\"/></svg><h3>Published annually</h3><p>Transparent reporting shared with members, partners and the community.</p></li>\n      <li><span>03</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 3.2l7 2.6v5.4c0 4.6-3 8.2-7 9.6-4-1.4-7-5-7-9.6V5.8z\"/><path d=\"M8.8 12l2.2 2.2 4.2-4.4\"/></svg><h3>Third-party verified</h3><p>Independent verification of impact claims and fund allocation <em>(proposed)</em>.</p></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"e15cfb4c","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"Section 7","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"775e8c22","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"wrap section section--flush-top\"><div class=\"xflag reveal\" role=\"note\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">!</span><p>AFSVHCL™ is in active development. All impact targets, fund commitments and program outcomes described are aspirational and subject to financing, program launch, partner capacity and feasibility analysis. No programs are currently active.</p></div></section>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"aa771628","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"content_width":"full","_title":"cta.band","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":0,"column":"0","row":"0"}},"elements":[{"id":"d8fa19cc","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","settings":{"html":"<section class=\"cta-band\" data-el=\"cta.band\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"cta-band__inner band--navy\">\n      <span class=\"cta-band__glow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      <h2 class=\"reveal\">Be part of the impact.</h2>\n      <div class=\"btn-row btn-row--stack\"><a class=\"btn btn--gold\" href=\"{{url:/membership/}}\">Explore membership<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--line-light\" href=\"{{url:/contact/}}\">Contact us<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"icon \" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M4 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"},"elements":[]}]}]}